{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You have a TypeSafe API key and you want typed answers from Jev.\nInstall "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-typesafe"},{"type":"text","value":". Then pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"typesafeDecider"},{"type":"text","value":" to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"decide()"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The adapter covers evaluate only. It talks to TypeSafe over "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fetch"},{"type":"text","value":". There is no TypeSafe SDK."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@tanstack/ai\",\"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"evaluate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Evaluate"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { decide, choice, score, boolean } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { typesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst ticket = {\n  subject: \"Charged twice for the same invoice\",\n  body: \"Please refund the extra payment.\",\n};\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: typesafeDecider(\"jev-latest\"),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: \"Which team should handle this ticket?\",\n      options: {\n        billing: \"Payments, invoices, refunds\",\n        tech: \"Bugs, outages, integrations\",\n        sales: \"Pricing, upgrades, new accounts\",\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: \"How urgent is this ticket?\",\n      levels: [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: \"Is the customer asking for a refund?\",\n    }),\n  },\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.queue.value);\nconsole.log(result.queue.probability);\nconsole.log(result.queue.confidence);\nconsole.log(result.meta.usage);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For question helpers, the result shape, abort, and middleware, see "},{"type":"link","href":"../evaluate/evaluate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Evaluate"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"models","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Models"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"jev-latest"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current stable Jev alias"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"jev-1.13.0"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pinned Jev release"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can also pass other TypeSafe model ids as a string."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"environment-variables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Environment Variables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The adapter reads your API key from the environment:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"TYPESAFE_API_KEY=your-typesafe-api-key","lang":"bash"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Variable"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TYPESAFE_API_KEY"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Yes"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your TypeSafe API key"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Get a key from "},{"type":"link","href":"https://typesafe.ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeSafe"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"explicit-api-keys","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Explicit API Keys"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To pass a key directly, use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createTypesafeDecider"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createTypesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst adapter = createTypesafeDecider(\n  \"jev-latest\",\n  process.env.MY_TYPESAFE_KEY!,\n);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"behind-a-proxy","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Behind a proxy"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route every request through a gateway with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"baseURL"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultHeaders"},{"type":"text","value":".\nThese two option names are the same on every TanStack AI adapter."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createTypesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst adapter = createTypesafeDecider(\n  \"jev-latest\",\n  process.env.TYPESAFE_API_KEY!,\n  {\n    baseURL: \"https://gateway.example.com/typesafe\",\n    defaultHeaders: {\n      \"cf-aig-authorization\": `Bearer ${process.env.GATEWAY_TOKEN}`,\n    },\n  },\n);","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"baseUrl"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"headers"},{"type":"text","value":" are aliases of the same two options. If you set both forms, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"baseURL"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultHeaders"},{"type":"text","value":" win."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"api-reference","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Reference"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"typesafedecider-model-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"typesafeDecider(model, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates an evaluate adapter. It reads "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TYPESAFE_API_KEY"},{"type":"text","value":" from the environment."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"model"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"jev-latest\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"jev-1.13.0\""},{"type":"text","value":", or another TypeSafe model id"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.baseURL"},{"type":"text","value":": override the API base URL (default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"https://api.typesafe.ai"},{"type":"text","value":"). "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"baseUrl"},{"type":"text","value":" is an alias."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.defaultHeaders"},{"type":"text","value":": extra request headers. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"headers"},{"type":"text","value":" is an alias."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.fetch"},{"type":"text","value":": override "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fetch"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"config.timeout"},{"type":"text","value":": request timeout in milliseconds"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"createtypesafedecider-model-apikey-config","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createTypesafeDecider(model, apiKey, config?)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Same as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"typesafeDecider"},{"type":"text","value":" with an explicit API key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The adapter sends "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"POST /v1/systemone"},{"type":"text","value":" to that base URL."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../evaluate/evaluate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Evaluate guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":": full "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"decide()"},{"type":"text","value":" walkthrough"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../tutorials/evaluate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Evaluate a ticket"}]},{"type":"text","value":": build a Start route"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../media/generation-hooks.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generation Hooks"}]},{"type":"text","value":": usage and lifecycle middleware"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"evaluate","text":"Evaluate","level":2},{"id":"models","text":"Models","level":2},{"id":"environment-variables","text":"Environment Variables","level":2},{"id":"explicit-api-keys","text":"Explicit API Keys","level":2},{"id":"behind-a-proxy","text":"Behind a proxy","level":2},{"id":"api-reference","text":"API Reference","level":2},{"id":"typesafedecider-model-config","text":"typesafeDecider(model, config?)","level":3},{"id":"createtypesafedecider-model-apikey-config","text":"createTypesafeDecider(model, apiKey, config?)","level":3},{"id":"next-steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2}]},"frameworks":["react","vue","solid","svelte","preact","angular","vanilla","octane"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nYou have a TypeSafe API key and you want typed answers from Jev.\nInstall `@tanstack/ai-typesafe`. Then pass `typesafeDecider` to `decide()`.\n\nThe adapter covers evaluate only. It talks to TypeSafe over `fetch`. There is no TypeSafe SDK.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nvue: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nsolid: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\npreact: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nangular: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\noctane: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Evaluate\n\n```typescript\nimport { decide, choice, score, boolean } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { typesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst ticket = {\n  subject: \"Charged twice for the same invoice\",\n  body: \"Please refund the extra payment.\",\n};\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: typesafeDecider(\"jev-latest\"),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: \"Which team should handle this ticket?\",\n      options: {\n        billing: \"Payments, invoices, refunds\",\n        tech: \"Bugs, outages, integrations\",\n        sales: \"Pricing, upgrades, new accounts\",\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: \"How urgent is this ticket?\",\n      levels: [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: \"Is the customer asking for a refund?\",\n    }),\n  },\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.queue.value);\nconsole.log(result.queue.probability);\nconsole.log(result.queue.confidence);\nconsole.log(result.meta.usage);\n```\n\nFor question helpers, the result shape, abort, and middleware, see [Evaluate](../evaluate/evaluate).\n\n## Models\n\n| Model        | Description                |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `jev-latest` | Current stable Jev alias   |\n| `jev-1.13.0` | Pinned Jev release         |\n\nYou can also pass other TypeSafe model ids as a string.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nThe adapter reads your API key from the environment:\n\n```bash\nTYPESAFE_API_KEY=your-typesafe-api-key\n```\n\n| Variable           | Required | Description            |\n| ------------------ | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` | Yes      | Your TypeSafe API key  |\n\nGet a key from [TypeSafe](https://typesafe.ai).\n\n## Explicit API Keys\n\nTo pass a key directly, use `createTypesafeDecider`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createTypesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst adapter = createTypesafeDecider(\n  \"jev-latest\",\n  process.env.MY_TYPESAFE_KEY!,\n);\n```\n\n## Behind a proxy\n\nRoute every request through a gateway with `baseURL` and `defaultHeaders`.\nThese two option names are the same on every TanStack AI adapter.\n\n```typescript\nimport { createTypesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst adapter = createTypesafeDecider(\n  \"jev-latest\",\n  process.env.TYPESAFE_API_KEY!,\n  {\n    baseURL: \"https://gateway.example.com/typesafe\",\n    defaultHeaders: {\n      \"cf-aig-authorization\": `Bearer ${process.env.GATEWAY_TOKEN}`,\n    },\n  },\n);\n```\n\n`baseUrl` and `headers` are aliases of the same two options. If you set both forms, `baseURL` and `defaultHeaders` win.\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `typesafeDecider(model, config?)`\n\nCreates an evaluate adapter. It reads `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` from the environment.\n\n- `model`: `\"jev-latest\"`, `\"jev-1.13.0\"`, or another TypeSafe model id\n- `config.baseURL`: override the API base URL (default `https://api.typesafe.ai`). `baseUrl` is an alias.\n- `config.defaultHeaders`: extra request headers. `headers` is an alias.\n- `config.fetch`: override `fetch`\n- `config.timeout`: request timeout in milliseconds\n\n### `createTypesafeDecider(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nSame as `typesafeDecider` with an explicit API key.\n\nThe adapter sends `POST /v1/systemone` to that base URL.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Evaluate guide](../evaluate/evaluate): full `decide()` walkthrough\n- [Evaluate a ticket](../tutorials/evaluate): build a Start route\n- [Generation Hooks](../media/generation-hooks.md): usage and lifecycle middleware\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: TypeSafe\nid: typesafe-adapter\ndescription: \"Use TypeSafe Jev with TanStack AI via @tanstack/ai-typesafe: typed evaluate decisions with decide(), choice(), score(), and boolean().\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - typesafe\n  - jev\n  - evaluate\n  - decide\n  - typed decisions\n  - adapter\n---\n\nYou have a TypeSafe API key and you want typed answers from Jev.\nInstall `@tanstack/ai-typesafe`. Then pass `typesafeDecider` to `decide()`.\n\nThe adapter covers evaluate only. It talks to TypeSafe over `fetch`. There is no TypeSafe SDK.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nvue: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nsolid: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\npreact: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nangular: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\noctane: @tanstack/ai @tanstack/ai-typesafe\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Evaluate\n\n```typescript\nimport { decide, choice, score, boolean } from \"@tanstack/ai\";\nimport { typesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst ticket = {\n  subject: \"Charged twice for the same invoice\",\n  body: \"Please refund the extra payment.\",\n};\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: typesafeDecider(\"jev-latest\"),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: \"Which team should handle this ticket?\",\n      options: {\n        billing: \"Payments, invoices, refunds\",\n        tech: \"Bugs, outages, integrations\",\n        sales: \"Pricing, upgrades, new accounts\",\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: \"How urgent is this ticket?\",\n      levels: [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: \"Is the customer asking for a refund?\",\n    }),\n  },\n});\n\nconsole.log(result.queue.value);\nconsole.log(result.queue.probability);\nconsole.log(result.queue.confidence);\nconsole.log(result.meta.usage);\n```\n\nFor question helpers, the result shape, abort, and middleware, see [Evaluate](../evaluate/evaluate).\n\n## Models\n\n| Model        | Description                |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `jev-latest` | Current stable Jev alias   |\n| `jev-1.13.0` | Pinned Jev release         |\n\nYou can also pass other TypeSafe model ids as a string.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nThe adapter reads your API key from the environment:\n\n```bash\nTYPESAFE_API_KEY=your-typesafe-api-key\n```\n\n| Variable           | Required | Description            |\n| ------------------ | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` | Yes      | Your TypeSafe API key  |\n\nGet a key from [TypeSafe](https://typesafe.ai).\n\n## Explicit API Keys\n\nTo pass a key directly, use `createTypesafeDecider`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createTypesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst adapter = createTypesafeDecider(\n  \"jev-latest\",\n  process.env.MY_TYPESAFE_KEY!,\n);\n```\n\n## Behind a proxy\n\nRoute every request through a gateway with `baseURL` and `defaultHeaders`.\nThese two option names are the same on every TanStack AI adapter.\n\n```typescript\nimport { createTypesafeDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-typesafe\";\n\nconst adapter = createTypesafeDecider(\n  \"jev-latest\",\n  process.env.TYPESAFE_API_KEY!,\n  {\n    baseURL: \"https://gateway.example.com/typesafe\",\n    defaultHeaders: {\n      \"cf-aig-authorization\": `Bearer ${process.env.GATEWAY_TOKEN}`,\n    },\n  },\n);\n```\n\n`baseUrl` and `headers` are aliases of the same two options. If you set both forms, `baseURL` and `defaultHeaders` win.\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `typesafeDecider(model, config?)`\n\nCreates an evaluate adapter. It reads `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` from the environment.\n\n- `model`: `\"jev-latest\"`, `\"jev-1.13.0\"`, or another TypeSafe model id\n- `config.baseURL`: override the API base URL (default `https://api.typesafe.ai`). `baseUrl` is an alias.\n- `config.defaultHeaders`: extra request headers. `headers` is an alias.\n- `config.fetch`: override `fetch`\n- `config.timeout`: request timeout in milliseconds\n\n### `createTypesafeDecider(model, apiKey, config?)`\n\nSame as `typesafeDecider` with an explicit API key.\n\nThe adapter sends `POST /v1/systemone` to that base URL.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Evaluate guide](../evaluate/evaluate): full `decide()` walkthrough\n- [Evaluate a ticket](../tutorials/evaluate): build a Start route\n- [Generation Hooks](../media/generation-hooks.md): usage and lifecycle middleware\n"}
